Usage: eval "$(cloudburrow gcloud-setup [flags])"

Write a gcloud configuration named cloudburrow-<name>, with credentials disabled and these
API endpoint overrides pointing at this instance:
  storage, pubsub, cloudkms, secretmanager, cloudtasks, cloudscheduler, logging, cloudresourcemanager
and print the export that selects it in this shell. Your default configuration is never
changed.
